581
00:52:59,555 --> 00:53:01,223
No me la perdería.

582
00:53:02,307 --> 00:53:04,518
Me refugiaste del mal

583
00:53:05,644 --> 00:53:06,854
Me mantuviste abrigado

584
00:53:07,020 --> 00:53:08,313
¿Qué es eso?

585
00:53:09,231 --> 00:53:10,232
Me mantuviste abrigado

586
00:53:10,399 --> 00:53:11,441
Dios mío.

587
00:53:12,693 --> 00:53:13,777
No puede ser.

588
00:53:14,361 --> 00:53:15,529
Sí puede ser.

589
00:53:17,239 --> 00:53:19,700
Me refugiaste del mal

590
00:53:21,034 --> 00:53:23,537
Me mantuviste abrigado

